================================================================================
Rust dependencies
================================================================================

The shipped binary statically links ~380 Rust crates. Their notices are
reproduced in full in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md, generated from the dependency
graph via `cargo about generate about.hbs -o THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md`.

Two entries there deserve explicit mention:

  - ring is licensed "Apache-2.0 AND ISC" -- conjunctive, not a choice. Both
    notices apply, together with its bundled BoringSSL notice.
  - 27 crates carry Unicode-3.0, covering the Unicode Character Database tables
    compiled into the binary.

Build-only dependencies (bindgen's clang-sys, the r-efi UEFI shim) are excluded:
they never ship in the binary and carry no redistribution obligation.
